   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div><br></div><div>I have a large dataset where I am trying to compare the distributions between treatments using ECDF. In this toy example, I have two treatments, each with two samples. I want to plot all 4 sample ECDFs on a single plot, but colored by treatment. I can get it to color the lines by sample (giving 4 colored lines), OR I can get it to plot by treatment (giving 2 colored lines). What I can&#39;t figure out is how to plot all four lines, but color them by treatment:</div><div><br></div><div>This gives me the nearest to what I want (but with 4 colors):</div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>test_df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">501</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">201</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                     treatment</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;treatment.1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                               rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;treatment.1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                               rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;treatment.2&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                               rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;treatment.2&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                     sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;sample.1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;sample.2&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;sample.3&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;sample.4&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">test_df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">..</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  stat_ecdf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">geom </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;step&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_x_continuous</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">expand </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Length&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_y_continuous</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">limits </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(-.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">01</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.01</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> expand </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cumulative frequency&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">How do I get all four lines to plot, but colored by treatment?</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Thanks!</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Ben</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
